[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Public Low Level Requirements
UID: GSSC-PUBLIC-LOW-LEVEL-REQUIREMENTS
VERSION: 5.0.0

[GRAMMAR]
ELEMENTS:
- TAG: TEXT
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: STATEMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
- TAG: SECTION
  PROPERTIES:
    IS_COMPOSITE: True
    PREFIX: None
    VIEW_STYLE: Narrative
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: TITLE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
- TAG: REQUIREMENT
  PROPERTIES:
    PREFIX: GSSC-PLLR-
    VIEW_STYLE: Table
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: TITLE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: STATEMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: RATIONALE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: COMMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: DERIVED
    TYPE: SingleChoice(True, False)
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: VERIFICATION_METHOD
    TYPE: SingleChoice(Test, Inspection)
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: CHANGE_DRIVER
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: REVIEW_STATUS
    TYPE: SingleChoice(Changed, Approved, Baselined)
    REQUIRED: True
  RELATIONS:
  - TYPE: Parent
    ROLE: Refines
    REVERSE_ROLE: Refined By

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-TESTING-FRAMEWORK
TITLE: Testing Framework

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-1
TITLE: Shared Test Harness
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend SHALL provide a shared unit-test harness beside the public application source for later public frontend low-level requirement tests.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Public frontend low-level requirements need one place for shared TestBed setup and DOM helpers. Feature tickets keep their own tests and import that harness.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-39
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-2
TITLE: One Test Per Low Level Requirement
STATEMENT: >>>
Each GSSC Website Public Frontend low-level requirement with Test verification SHALL have one dedicated unit test that checks the status that requirement's statement names.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
One accurate test per requirement keeps traceability clear. Feature tickets add those tests; this requirement sets the convention the harness supports.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-39
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-3
TITLE: Public Frontend Test Runner
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend SHALL run its unit tests through the monorepo public frontend test task.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Root and app-local mise tasks already name the public frontend tests. The harness rides that runner so later tickets do not add a second stack.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-39
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[[/SECTION]]
